OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FHow Copa 71, the first women's
OL,7,     FWorld Cup, took on football's 'old
OL,8,     Fmen'. We hear from two Danish
OL,9,     Ffootballers who played in the most
OL,10,     Fwatched women's sporting event in
OL,11,     Fhistory.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1964, a group of teenage boys
OL,14,     Forganised a convention in New
OL,15,     FYork, now recognised as the first
OL,16,     Fofficial Comic Con. It kickstarted
OL,17,     Fwhat's become a worldwide cultural
OL,18,     Fphenomenon.
